# deps.pins — build-time dependency pin ledger.
# Injected at `nimble setup` via --requires (Makefile and CI); the published
# logos_delivery.nimble keeps ranges, so dependents never inherit these.
# One pin per line. Lines starting with '#' are comments (start of line only:
# URL pins legitimately contain '#'). Same syntax as Nimble requires.

